	He should have dropped the Book the first time you killed him.  Go
back to the top of his tower and look for it there.  If he was standing over
water when he died, grab an amulet of magical breathing and go for a swim.

>    As for the candelabrum, I've found no evidence of anything looking like
>Vlad's tower after searching Gehennom to the point where a second tower
>should be obvious. ...

	There is one level of Gehennom which has two up staircases.  One of
them leads to Vlad's tower.  This is the only way in and the only indication
you will get that it is near.

>    What am I missing?	This is NH 3.1.0; were some of these features added
